# Supabase Configuration
# Get these values from your Supabase project dashboard: Settings > API
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# Optional: If you need to run the app without a Supabase instance,
# simply leave these unset. The app will fall back to a mock client
# in development mode (limited functionality).

# Setup Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to .env:  cp .env.example .env
# 2. Replace with your Supabase project values
# 3. Run the schema against your Supabase database:
#    - Open supabase-schema.sql in Supabase SQL Editor (or use CLI: supabase db push)
#    - Or run migrations: npx supabase migration up
# 4. Start the app: pnpm dev
